1
00:00:04,689 --> 00:00:06,769
(Leonard:)There you go.
Now any e-mail from Wolowitz...

2
00:00:06,941 --> 00:00:09,231
(Leonard:)...will go right into your spam folder.

3
00:00:09,861 --> 00:00:11,781
Thanks. The e-mail doesn't bother me...

4
00:00:11,946 --> 00:00:15,116
(Penny:)...as much as the vacation pictures
of him in a bathing suit.

5
00:00:15,617 --> 00:00:17,497
(Leonard:)Yeah, I got the same one.

6
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:21,160
(Leonard:)And that's not a bathing suit,
it's a tan line.

7
00:00:26,085 --> 00:00:28,625
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello, this is Sheldon Cooper.

8
00:00:28,796 --> 00:00:32,136
I am leaving a message for Barry Kripke.

9
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,720
(Sheldon(on phone):)Barry, it was pleasant seeing you today
in the cafeteria.

10
00:00:36,888 --> 00:00:39,848
(Sheldon(on phone):)I saw that you purchased
the chef's salad.

11
00:00:40,016 --> 00:00:42,476
(Sheldon(on phone):)Apparently, you did not know
that the chef's salad...

12
00:00:42,644 --> 00:00:45,934
(Sheldon(on phone):)...is kitchen trickery
to utilize scrap meat.

13
00:00:47,315 --> 00:00:49,985
(Sheldon(on phone):)Nevertheless, I hope you enjoyed it.

14
00:00:50,151 --> 00:00:52,491
(Sheldon(on phone):)I'm following up
on our pending friendship.

15
00:00:52,654 --> 00:00:56,954
(Sheldon(on phone):)And I look forward
to hearing from you regarding its status.

16
00:00:57,325 --> 00:01:01,025
(Sheldon(on phone):)Sheldon Cooper.

